    "title": "South Walton advances to regional semi's after win over Suwannee - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Karli Koskovich ,\n41 minutes ago\nSANTA ROSA BEACH, Fla. ( WMBB ) – The South Walton Seahawks defeated the Suwannee Bulldogs 3-0 Wednesday night in the 4A FHSAA regional quarterfinals.\nThe Seahawks advance to 19-7 and will host Yulee on Saturday, October 25, in the regional semifinals..\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to mypanhandle.com.",
